<section
  class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-white p-4 shadow-sm sm:p-8"
  aria-labelledby="galaxy-cz-intro"
>
  <div class="mb-3">
    <h2 id="galaxy-cz-intro" class="text-2xl font-bold text-galaxy-dark">
      Open, reproducible data analysis for Czechia
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-chicago-700">
      The Czech Galaxy Community, supported jointly by <strong>
        <a
          class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
          href="https://www.cesnet.cz/en">CESNET</a
        >
      </strong> and <strong>
        <a
          class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
          href="https://www.elixir-czech.cz/">ELIXIR Czechia</a
        >
      </strong>, provides <strong>free, accessible, and reproducible computational analysis</strong> for researchers in Czechia
      and beyond. Thousands of documented and maintained tools, backed by robust public infrastructure.
    </p>
    <p class="mt-4 text-chicago-700">
      Access across our servers is federated through <a
        class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
        href="https://www.e-infra.cz/en">e-INFRA CZ</a
      > login and <a
        class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
        href="https://lifescience-ri.eu/ls-login/">Life Science</a
      > login.
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="grid gap-3 text-sm text-chicago-700 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-galaxy-dark">
        <a class="hover:text-galaxy-gold" href="https://usegalaxy.cz/">UseGalaxy.cz</a>
      </strong>
      General-purpose national instance bridging users to MetaCentrum, the Czech national computational grid.
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-galaxy-dark">
        <a class="hover:text-galaxy-gold" href="https://repeatexplorer-elixir.cerit-sc.cz/galaxy/">RepeatExplorer</a>
      </strong>
      ELIXIR CZ sponsored server for genomics researchers working with repetitive DNA.
    </li>
    <li class="rounded-lg border border-galaxy-primary/10 bg-bay-of-many-50 p-4">
      <strong class="block text-galaxy-dark">
        <a class="hover:text-galaxy-gold" href="https://galaxy-umsa.grid.cesnet.cz/">UMSA</a>
      </strong>
      Untargeted mass spectrometry and cheminformatics pipelines for the RECETOX community.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3 id="galaxy-cz-offer" class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-galaxy-dark">What we offer</h3>
  <ul class="mt-3 list-disc space-y-1.5 pl-5 text-sm text-chicago-700">
    <li>Thousands of tools ready to use, updated via an automated, CI-validated tool management pipeline.</li>
    <li>Access to the MetaCentrum national computational grid for heavy workloads.</li>
    <li>
      Extra quotas and resources for Czech researchers and their collaborators, see the <a
        class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
        href="https://docs.metacentrum.cz/en/docs/graphical/usegalaxy">homepage</a>
    </li>
    <li>
      Training and support for the Czech research community via the <a
        class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
        href="https://usegalaxy.cz/tiaas/">TIaaS</a
      >.
    </li>
    <li>Integration pilot with the National Repository Platform (NRP) for FAIR data workflows.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 id="galaxy-cz-team" class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-galaxy-dark">Team</h3>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-chicago-700">
    The <a class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold" href="/cz/people/"
      >Czech Galaxy team</a
    > curates these services, develops community tools and training, and represents Czechia in the global Galaxy community.
  </p>

  <h3 id="galaxy-cz-contact" class="mt-8 text-xl font-bold text-galaxy-dark">Contact us</h3>
  <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-chicago-700">
    For any questions please reach out at <a
      class="text-galaxy-primary underline underline-offset-2 hover:text-galaxy-gold"
      href="mailto:galaxy@cesnet.cz">galaxy@cesnet.cz</a
    >.
  </p>

